<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>${project_name}</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>${project_name}</h1>
  <p>SST DevOps &amp; Cloud - Session 19: Cloud &amp; Terraform in Action (Saptak Banerjee)</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Served by: nginx on EC2 instance __INSTANCE_ID__ in __AZ__</li>
