    <li>VPC: ${vpc_cidr} / public subnet ${subnet_cidr}</li>
    <li>Page source: s3://${bucket_name}/site/index.html (private bucket, read via instance role)</li>
    <li>Provisioned by: Terraform</li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
